# AGENTS.override.md (example)

Personal overrides on top of committed `AGENTS.md`. Copy to `AGENTS.override.md`
at the repo root and keep it gitignored (scan adds the ignore rule).

Use for machine-specific ports, private checklist tweaks, or stricter personal rules.
Agents: if `AGENTS.override.md` exists, treat it as higher priority for this developer only.

```markdown
# My overrides

- Local app URL: http://localhost:3001
- Always run typecheck before claiming done
- Never commit lockfile changes unless I ask
```
